            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">by</span>
            <img src="/brand/webadish-logo-white.png" alt="WebAdish LLP" class="h-11 w-auto" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Specialist WordPress emergency recovery and malware removal by WebAdish LLP.
